WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:02,010
Looking at Lu Tou and Kyun Zi

2
00:00:02,010 --> 00:00:03,410
At least forty or fifty years

3
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:05,330
It's still the best fresh product that just came out.

4
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:06,450
Lin Zishu

5
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:14,150
How much do you want to sell this suit for? Three to three hundred

6
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:15,910
Two hundred is fine too

7
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:17,750
As long as it can be replaced by food, it can save lives

8
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:18,870
Lin Zishu

9
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:21,290
If I take this body for three hundred dollars

10
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:22,850
That's a shameful conscience that deceives you

11
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:25,450
This is wild fresh food from forty or fifty years old

12
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:27,570
Meet someone who really needs his help

13
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:29,010
Negotiate if the price is higher

14
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:39,080
It's not impossible to get close to a thousand yuan, even a thousand days.

15
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,800
Uncle, I don’t need so much cash.

16
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:41,960
As long as it can be exchanged for food

17
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:44,040
Let the baby eat as many times as you like.

18
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:44,960
I'll take the body first

19
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,080
Help you find a big buyer

20
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:47,280
As for eating and rescuing people from emergencies,

21
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,600
I'll find a way for you tonight
